Download and create Win 11 VM

Download VMBox Guest additions and add to unattended install. Enable bidirectional copy+paste in VM
  
Run sysprep

cd C:\Windows\System32\Sysprep
sysprep.exe /oobe /generalize /shutdown /mode:vm

if error check C:\Windows\System32\Sysprep\Panther\setuperr.log in notepad

notepad C:\Windows\System32\Sysprep\Panther\setuperr.log

manage-bde -status C: #make sure it's fully decrypted. takes some time
manage-bde -off C:

#Turn off VM once done with sysprep. DOn't turn on again
# right click vm, select clone, set linked clone, new adapter and MAC
#NOTE: Use NAT connection type for adapter and choose domain join
